		'Shared logic is src/common/uploads.ts: the placeholder names the attach command id ([uploading image <id>]), settle() maps attached/rejected to the text that replaces it, swap() keeps caret and selection, wait()/resume makes Enter during an upload send once the last upload of that session lands (not after a failure). The terminal side is src/client/paste.ts (+ pasteboard.ts for macOS FFI, clipboard.image for Linux), the web side src/web/attach.ts and Composer.tsx (app.rewrite edits the textarea in place so the caret stays).',
		'Size is checked before reading or sending (uploads.tooBig, File.size / stat): a command over the WebSocket 16 MB payload limit would drop the connection and be resent forever by the connection core.',
